cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Please also cite the accompanying paper (preferred citation)."
type: software
title: "process-validation-consensus: agent-layer process-validation consensus for decentralized LLM multi-agent systems"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype in which peers validate each agent's committed reasoning log, rather than its
  final output, with a mechanical and recomputable predicate. A simulated hash-chained ledger serves
  only as a tamper-evident record. Includes the offline GSM8K experiments (H1, H1b, H3, H1-U),
  their results and the independent audit scripts.
